{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52427","headline":"回波乐 七十 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 七十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人间养男女，直（项校「真」）成鸟养儿。\n长大毛衣好，各自觅高飞。\n女嫁他将去，儿心（戴校「征」）死不归。\n夫妻一个死，喻如黄擘皮。\n重重被剥削，独苦自身知。\n生在常烦恼，死後无人悲。\n寄语冥路道，还我未生时。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}